@startuml
title UTrabajo — Límites de confianza S13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Usuario" as User
node "Dispositivo Android" as Android
node "API Spring Boot" as API {
  component "Spring Security" as Sec
  component "Controllers" as Ctrl
  component "Services/Auth" as Svc
}
database "PostgreSQL 16" as DB
folder "Upload storage" as Files
cloud "CI / dependencias / imágenes" as Supply
component "Endpoints internos experimentales" as Internal

User --> Android
Android --> Sec : HTTP/JSON + Bearer
TB-1
Sec --> Ctrl
Ctrl --> Svc
Svc --> DB : JDBC
TB-2
Svc --> Files : lectura/escritura
TB-3
Files --> Android : /uploads/** actual
TB-4
Supply --> API : build/runtime
TB-5
Internal --> API : X-Integration-Token
TB-6

note right of Android
En local se usa HTTP.
Fuera de local: HTTPS obligatorio.
end note

note right of Files
Documentos sensibles no deben
quedar públicos en producción.
end note

note bottom of Supply
Revisar dependencias, Actions
e imágenes como supply chain.
end note
@enduml
